    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey so i was moving some heavy furniture earlier today and i think i really messed up my back. i felt this crazy rippling/tearing sensation in the middle of my back and now it's kind of bleeding down into my stomach area. it hurts a lot. do u think i just pulled a muscle? can i just take a bunch of ibuprofen and sleep it off?",
