    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "idk i just really dont want to go to the er if i dont have to. it's super expensive and im pretty sure i just overdid it at the gym/moving. if i take a high dose of ibuprofen like 800mg every few hours for the next day or so, will that help the tearing feeling go away? i just want to manage the pain at home so i can sleep.",
