      "content": "I strongly advise against taking high doses of ibuprofen without consulting a doctor. While it may provide temporary pain relief, taking too much or using it for an extended period can cause stomach problems, interact with other medications, and potentially mask more serious underlying injuries. It's better to err on the side of caution and see a doctor to get a proper evaluation and treatment plan, even if it's inconvenient. The tearing feeling could be a sign of a more serious injury that requires medical attention.",
